'''Eldritch''' is a monster category, as well as a property typically exclusive to monsters and [[boss]]es in the endgame of [[map]]s and the [[Atlas of Worlds]].

Monster types with the eldritch property:

*[[Eldritch Horrors]]
*[[Elder Guardian]]s
*[[The Incarnations]]
*[[The Maven]]
*[[The Elder]]
*[[Uber Elder]]

